  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-maroon pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Draconic Power Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0e/Miraak_and_other_Dragonborns_are_shown_to_have_this_ability..png/revision/latest?cb=20250523084235\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Miraak and other Dragonborns are shown to have this ability.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0e/Miraak_and_other_Dragonborns_are_shown_to_have_this_ability..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20250523084235\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0e/Miraak_and_other_Dragonborns_are_shown_to_have_this_ability..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20250523084235 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0e/Miraak_and_other_Dragonborns_are_shown_to_have_this_ability..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20250523084235 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Miraak and other Dragonborns are shown to have this ability.\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Miraak_and_other_Dragonborns_are_shown_to_have_this_ability..png\" data-image-name=\"Miraak and other Dragonborns are shown to have this ability..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Dragonborns (Elder Scrolls series) like Miraak killed a dragon to absorb its powers.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb/steal the power of dragons.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb/steal the powers of dragons</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon_Force_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dragon Force Manipulation\">Dragon Force Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Dragon Power Absorption/Theft</li>\n<li>Draconian Power Absorption/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb and/or steal the powers of dragons, rendering them powerless and vulnerable, potentially allowing the user to become dragons themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Power_Negation\" title=\"Draconic Power Negation\">Draconic Power Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dragon_Physiology\" title=\"Dragon Physiology\">Dragon Physiology</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Dragon_Physiology/Transcendent\" title=\"Dragon Physiology/Transcendent\">Transcendent Dragon Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Enhanced Power Absorption\">Enhanced Power Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Replication/Superior\" title=\"Superpower Replication/Superior\">Superior</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Replication\" title=\"Magic Replication\">Magic Replication</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Draconic Energy Manipulation\">Draconic Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May overload with stolen powers.\n<ul><li>The user’s body may become unstable as a result.</li>\n<li>If killed, the powers may return to their previous owners.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb powers of dragons, not energies.</li>\n<li>Cannot steal the powers of an omnipotent dragon.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Dragon Devourers (<i>Age of Adepts</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://adjl.fandom.com/wiki/Sphinx\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:adjl:Sphinx\">Sphinx Hair Users</a> (<i>American Dragon: Jake Long</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://records-of-dungeon-travel.fandom.com/wiki/Kim_Jinwoo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:records-of-dungeon-travel:Kim Jinwoo\">Kim Jinwoo</a> (<i>Dungeon Odyssey</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Acnologia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Acnologia\">Acnologia</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Fifth Generation Dragon Slayers (<i>Fairy Tail: The 100 Years Quest</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://herokiller.fandom.com/wiki/Ihwa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:herokiller:Ihwa\">Ihwa, the Hero Killer</a> (<i>Hero Killer</i>)</li>\n<li>Dragonborn (<i>Elder Scrolls</i> series); via killing dragons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Glossary:Iron_Fist\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Glossary:Iron Fist\">Iron Fist</a> Users (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDraconic_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" d